+enabled anywhere on vpsFree.cz nodes. The necessary RT implementation has
+therefore been absent, and this vulnerability has not affected those nodes.
+The archived configuration below is independent corroboration for one build;
+the broader conclusion rests on the operator's explicit historical statement.
+
